  "_comment": "Sample content for the demo import (inc/demo-import.php) and the catalogue screenshots, in en. Pages hold block markup; <!-- wp:pattern {\"slug\":\"...\"} /--> is expanded into the pattern on import, in the language the import runs in. Every language file has the same slugs; \"screens\" lists the pages the catalogue screenshots.",
